  1. Any work > 2 seconds: accept-then-process
  2. Always return a tracking handle (job ID or status URL)
  3. Always require an idempotency key for financial operations
  4. Persist PENDING record BEFORE enqueuing (crash-safe)
  5. Workers are independently scalable from the API
  6. Dead-letter queue for jobs that fail after N retries
  7. Monitor: queue depth, processing latency, DLQ size
```
